    "description": [
      "A few, small dead trees line the eastern edge of the path, bark blackened and limbs missing or barely hanging on by the merest splinter of wood.  Beyond those, deeper into a plot of land dotted with tombstones and grave markers, stands a modestly sized statue of a robed figure.  The figure's head is bowed, hands clasped with fingers laced just beneath her chin.  At her feet, a hodgepodge array of candles burn fitfully."
